    "description": "<p>You delicately pluck at the earth so that the damage doesn’t spread beyond your target. Each target hit by this spell suffers <strong>【HR + 10】 earth</strong> damage. This spell cannot target creatures who are flying, floating, falling, or otherwise in mid-air.</p><p><strong>Opportunity</strong>: On your next turn, you may cast <strong>Aftershock</strong> on all of the same targets who are still eligible, either before or after your action. It’s a copy of <strong>Tremor</strong> that doesn’t use your action and doesn’t have this <strong>Opportunity</strong>.</p><hr /><p><strong>@LOSS[5 mp]</strong> for <strong>one</strong> target.</p><p><strong>@LOSS[10 mp]</strong> for <strong>two</strong> targets.</p><p><strong>@LOSS[15 mp]</strong> for <strong>three</strong> targets.</p><p><strong>@LOSS[20 mp]</strong> for <strong>four</strong> targets.</p><p><strong>@LOSS[25 mp]</strong> for <strong>five</strong> targets.</p>",
